\s1 Rahab Welcomes the Spies
\r (\ref Hebrews 11:30–31|HEB 11:30-31\ref*)
\p \v 1 \w Then Joshua|strong="H3091"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Nun|strong="H5126"\w* \w secretly|strong="H2791"\w* \w sent|strong="H7971"\w* \w two|strong="H8147"\w* \w spies|strong="H7270"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w Shittim|strong="H7851"\w*,\f + \fr 2:1 \ft Or \fqa Acacia Grove\f* \w saying|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Go|strong="H1980"\w*, \w inspect|strong="H7200"\w* \w the land|strong="H776"\w*, \w especially Jericho|strong="H3405"\w*.” \w So they went|strong="H1980"\w* \w and entered|strong="H935"\w* \w the house|strong="H1004"\w* \w of a prostitute|strong="H2181"\w* \w named|strong="H8034"\w* \w Rahab|strong="H7343"\w* \w and stayed|strong="H7901"\w* \w there|strong="H8033"\w*.
\p \v 2 \w And it was reported|strong="H559"\w* \w to the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Jericho|strong="H3405"\w*: “\w Behold|strong="H2009"\w*, \w some men|strong="H582"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w have come|strong="H935"\w* \w here|strong="H2008"\w* \w tonight|strong="H3915"\w* \w to spy out|strong="H2658"\w* \w the land|strong="H776"\w*.”
\p \v 3 \w So the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Jericho|strong="H3405"\w* \w sent|strong="H7971"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Rahab|strong="H7343"\w* \w and said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Bring out|strong="H3318"\w* \w the men|strong="H582"\w* \w who came|strong="H935"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w you|strong="H834"\w* \w and entered|strong="H935"\w* \w your house|strong="H1004"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w they have come|strong="H935"\w* \w to spy out|strong="H2658"\w* \w the whole|strong="H3605"\w* \w land|strong="H776"\w*.”
\p \v 4 \w But the woman|strong="H802"\w* \w had taken|strong="H3947"\w* \w the two|strong="H8147"\w* \w men|strong="H582"\w* \w and hidden them|strong="H6845"\w*. \w So she said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Yes|strong="H3651"\w*, \w the men|strong="H582"\w* \w did come|strong="H935"\w* \w to me|strong="H413"\w*, \w but I did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w know|strong="H3045"\w* \w where|strong="H370"\w* \w they had come from|strong="H1992"\w*. \v 5 \w At dusk|strong="H2822"\w*, \w when the gate|strong="H8179"\w* \w was|strong="H1961"\w* \w about to close|strong="H5462"\w*, \w the men|strong="H582"\w* \w went out|strong="H3318"\w*, \w and I do not|strong="H3808"\w* \w know|strong="H3045"\w* \w which way|strong="H575"\w* \w they|strong="H582"\w* \w went|strong="H1980"\w*. \w Pursue|strong="H7291"\w* \w them|strong="H310"\w* \w quickly|strong="H4118"\w*, \w and|strong="H3588"\w* \w you may catch them|strong="H5381"\w*!” \v 6 (\w But Rahab|strong="H1931"\w* \w had taken them up|strong="H5927"\w* \w to the roof|strong="H1406"\w* \w and hidden them|strong="H2934"\w* \w among the stalks|strong="H6086"\w* \w of flax|strong="H6593"\w* \w that she had laid out|strong="H6186"\w* \w there|strong="H1406"\w*.)
\p \v 7 \w So the king’s men|strong="H582"\w* \w set out in pursuit|strong="H7291"\w* \w of the spies|strong="H310"\w* \w along the road|strong="H1870"\w* \w to|strong="H5921"\w* \w the fords|strong="H4569"\w* \w of the Jordan|strong="H3383"\w*, \w and as|strong="H834"\w* \w soon as they|strong="H3318"\w* \w had gone out|strong="H7291"\w*, \w the gate|strong="H8179"\w* \w was shut|strong="H5462"\w*.
\s1 The Promise to Rahab
\p \v 8 \w Before|strong="H2962"\w* \w the spies|strong="H1992"\w* \w lay down for the night|strong="H7901"\w*, \w Rahab|strong="H1931"\w* \w went up|strong="H5927"\w* \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w the roof|strong="H1406"\w* \v 9 \w and said|strong="H559"\w* \w to them|strong="H413"\w*, “\w I know|strong="H3045"\w* \w that|strong="H3588"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w has given|strong="H5414"\w* you \w this land|strong="H776"\w* \w and that|strong="H3588"\w* \w the fear of you|strong="H367"\w* \w has fallen|strong="H5307"\w* \w on us|strong="H5921"\w*, \w so that|strong="H3588"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w who dwell|strong="H3427"\w* \w in the land|strong="H776"\w* \w are melting in fear|strong="H4127"\w* \w of you|strong="H6440"\w*. \v 10 \w For|strong="H3588"\w* \w we have heard|strong="H8085"\w* \w how|strong="H834"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w dried up|strong="H3001"\w* \w the waters|strong="H4325"\w* \w of the Red|strong="H5488"\w* \w Sea|strong="H3220"\w*\f + \fr 2:10 \ft Or \fqa the Sea of Reeds\f* \w before you|strong="H6440"\w* \w when you came out|strong="H3318"\w* \w of Egypt|strong="H4714"\w*, \w and what|strong="H834"\w* \w you did|strong="H6213"\w* \w to Sihon|strong="H5511"\w* \w and Og|strong="H5747"\w*, \w the two|strong="H8147"\w* \w kings|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the Amorites|strong="H567"\w* \w across|strong="H5676"\w* \w the Jordan|strong="H3383"\w*, \w whom|strong="H834"\w* \w you devoted to destruction|strong="H2763"\w*.\f + \fr 2:10 \ft Forms of the Hebrew \fqa cherem \ft refer to the giving over of things or persons to the LORD, either by destroying them or by giving them as an offering.\f* \v 11 \w When we heard this|strong="H8085"\w*, \w our hearts|strong="H3824"\w* \w melted|strong="H4549"\w* \w and everyone’s|strong="H376"\w* \w courage|strong="H7307"\w* \w failed|strong="H3808"\w* \w because of you|strong="H6440"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w your God|strong="H430"\w* \w is God|strong="H430"\w* \w in the heavens|strong="H8064"\w* \w above|strong="H4605"\w* \w and on|strong="H5921"\w* \w the earth|strong="H776"\w* \w below|strong="H8478"\w*.
\p \v 12 \w Now therefore|strong="H6258"\w*, \w please|strong="H4994"\w* \w swear|strong="H7650"\w* to me \w by the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w that you|strong="H859"\w* \w will indeed|strong="H1571"\w* \w show|strong="H6213"\w* \w kindness|strong="H2617"\w* \w to|strong="H5973"\w* \w my family|strong="H1004"\w*, \w because|strong="H3588"\w* \w I showed|strong="H6213"\w* \w kindness|strong="H2617"\w* \w to you|strong="H5973"\w*. \w Give|strong="H5414"\w* me \w a sure|strong="H571"\w* \w sign|strong="H226"\w* \v 13 \w that you will spare the lives|strong="H2421"\w* \w of my father|strong="H1"\w* \w and|strong="H853"\w* \w mother|strong="H517"\w*, \w my brothers|strong="H251"\w* \w and|strong="H853"\w* \w sisters|strong="H269"\w*, \w and all|strong="H3605"\w* \w who belong|strong="H834"\w* to them, \w and that you will deliver|strong="H5337"\w* \w us|strong="H5315"\w* \w from death|strong="H4194"\w*.”
\p \v 14 “\w Our lives|strong="H5315"\w* \w for your|strong="H8478"\w* \w lives|strong="H4191"\w*!” \w the men|strong="H582"\w* \w agreed|strong="H559"\w*. “\w If|strong="H518"\w* \w you do not|strong="H3808"\w* \w report|strong="H5046"\w* \w our mission|strong="H1697"\w*, \w we will show|strong="H6213"\w* \w you|strong="H5973"\w* \w kindness|strong="H2617"\w* \w and faithfulness|strong="H571"\w* \w when the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w gives|strong="H5414"\w* us \w the land|strong="H776"\w*.”
\p \v 15 \w Then Rahab let them down|strong="H3381"\w* \w by a rope|strong="H2256"\w* \w through|strong="H1157"\w* \w the window|strong="H2474"\w*, \w since|strong="H3588"\w* \w the house|strong="H1004"\w* \w where she|strong="H1931"\w* \w lived|strong="H3427"\w* \w was built into the wall|strong="H7023"\w* \w of the city|strong="H2346"\w*. \v 16 “\w Go|strong="H1980"\w* \w to the hill country|strong="H2022"\w*,” \w she said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w so that your pursuers|strong="H7291"\w* \w will not|strong="H6435"\w* \w find|strong="H6293"\w* you. \w Hide yourselves|strong="H2247"\w* \w there|strong="H8033"\w* \w for three|strong="H7969"\w* \w days|strong="H3117"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w they|strong="H7291"\w* \w have returned|strong="H7725"\w*; \w then|strong="H310"\w* \w go|strong="H1980"\w* \w on your way|strong="H1870"\w*.”
\p \v 17 \w The men|strong="H582"\w* \w said|strong="H559"\w* \w to her|strong="H413"\w*, “\w We|strong="H587"\w* \w will not be bound|strong="H5355"\w* \w by this|strong="H2088"\w* \w oath|strong="H7621"\w* \w you made us swear|strong="H7650"\w* \v 18 \w unless|strong="H2009"\w*, \w when we|strong="H587"\w* \w enter|strong="H935"\w* \w the land|strong="H776"\w*, \w you have tied|strong="H7194"\w* \w this|strong="H2088"\w* \w scarlet|strong="H8144"\w* \w cord|strong="H8615"\w* \w in the window|strong="H2474"\w* \w through which|strong="H834"\w* \w you let us down|strong="H3381"\w*, \w and unless|strong="H853"\w* \w you have brought|strong="H622"\w* \w your father|strong="H1"\w* \w and|strong="H853"\w* \w mother|strong="H517"\w* \w and|strong="H853"\w* \w brothers|strong="H251"\w* \w and all|strong="H3605"\w* \w your family|strong="H1004"\w* \w into your house|strong="H1004"\w*. \v 19 \w If anyone|strong="H3605"\w* \w goes out|strong="H3318"\w* \w the door|strong="H1817"\w* \w of your house|strong="H1004"\w* \w into the street|strong="H2351"\w*, \w his blood will be|strong="H1818"\w* \w on his own head|strong="H7218"\w*, \w and we|strong="H587"\w* \w will be innocent|strong="H5355"\w*. \w But if|strong="H518"\w* \w a hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w is laid|strong="H1961"\w* on \w anyone|strong="H3605"\w* \w with you|strong="H854"\w* \w in the house|strong="H1004"\w*, \w his blood|strong="H1818"\w* \w will be on our heads|strong="H7218"\w*. \v 20 \w And if|strong="H518"\w* \w you report|strong="H5046"\w* \w our mission|strong="H1697"\w*, \w we will be|strong="H1961"\w* \w released|strong="H5355"\w* \w from the oath|strong="H7621"\w* \w you made us swear|strong="H7650"\w*.”
\p \v 21 “\w Let it|strong="H1931"\w* \w be as you say|strong="H1697"\w*,” \w she replied|strong="H559"\w*, \w and she sent them away|strong="H7971"\w*. \w And when they had gone|strong="H1980"\w*, \w she tied|strong="H7194"\w* \w the scarlet|strong="H8144"\w* \w cord|strong="H8615"\w* \w in the window|strong="H2474"\w*.
\p \v 22 \w So the spies went out|strong="H935"\w* \w into the hill country|strong="H2022"\w* \w and stayed|strong="H3427"\w* \w there|strong="H8033"\w* \w three|strong="H7969"\w* \w days|strong="H3117"\w*, \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w their pursuers|strong="H7291"\w* \w had returned|strong="H7725"\w* \w without|strong="H3808"\w* \w finding them|strong="H4672"\w*, \w having searched|strong="H1245"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w along the road|strong="H1870"\w*. \v 23 \w Then the two men|strong="H582"\w* \w started back|strong="H7725"\w*, \w came down|strong="H3381"\w* \w from the hill country|strong="H2022"\w*, \w and crossed the river|strong="H5674"\w*. \w So they came|strong="H935"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Joshua|strong="H3091"\w* \w son|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Nun|strong="H5126"\w* \w and reported|strong="H5608"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w that had happened|strong="H4672"\w* \w to them|strong="H854"\w*.
