\p \v 8 \w And|strong="H1961"\w* \w after|strong="H834"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the nation|strong="H1471"\w* \w had been circumcised|strong="H4135"\w*, \w they stayed|strong="H3427"\w* \w there|strong="H8478"\w* \w in the camp|strong="H4264"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w they were healed|strong="H2421"\w*.
