\c 6
\s1 The Walls of Jericho
\p \v 1 \w Now Jericho|strong="H3405"\w* \w was tightly shut up|strong="H5462"\w* \w because of|strong="H6440"\w* \w the Israelites|strong="H1121"\w*. \w No one|strong="H369"\w* \w went out|strong="H3318"\w* \w and no one|strong="H369"\w* \w came in|strong="H935"\w*.
