\p \v 20 \w So when the rams’ horns|strong="H7782"\w* \w sounded|strong="H8628"\w*, \w the people|strong="H5971"\w* \w shouted|strong="H7321"\w*. \w When they|strong="H5971"\w* \w heard|strong="H8085"\w* \w the blast|strong="H6963"\w* \w of the horn|strong="H7782"\w*, \w the people|strong="H5971"\w* \w gave a great|strong="H1419"\w* \w shout|strong="H7321"\w*, \w and the wall|strong="H2346"\w* \w collapsed|strong="H5307"\w*. \w Then all the people|strong="H5971"\w* \w charged|strong="H5927"\w* \w straight|strong="H5048"\w* \w into the city|strong="H5892"\w* \w and captured|strong="H3920"\w* \w it|strong="H5892"\w*. \v 21 \w With the edge|strong="H6310"\w* \w of the sword|strong="H2719"\w* \w they devoted to destruction|strong="H2763"\w* \w everything|strong="H3605"\w* \w in the city|strong="H5892"\w*— \w man|strong="H376"\w* \w and woman|strong="H802"\w*, \w young|strong="H5288"\w* \w and|strong="H5704"\w* \w old|strong="H2205"\w*, \w oxen|strong="H7794"\w*, \w sheep|strong="H7716"\w*, \w and donkeys|strong="H2543"\w*.
