\p \v 7 “\w O|strong="H162"\w*, \w Lord|strong="H136"\w* \w GOD|strong="H3069"\w*,” \w Joshua|strong="H3091"\w* \w said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w why|strong="H4100"\w* \w did You ever bring|strong="H5674"\w* \w this|strong="H2088"\w* \w people|strong="H5971"\w* \w across the Jordan|strong="H3383"\w* \w to deliver|strong="H5414"\w* \w us|strong="H853"\w* \w into the hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w of the Amorites|strong="H567"\w* \w to be destroyed|strong="H6"\w*? \w If only|strong="H3863"\w* \w we had been content|strong="H2974"\w* \w to stay|strong="H3427"\w* \w on the other side|strong="H5676"\w* \w of the Jordan|strong="H3383"\w*! \v 8 \w O|strong="H994"\w* \w Lord|strong="H136"\w*, \w what|strong="H4100"\w* \w can I say|strong="H559"\w*, \w now that|strong="H310"\w* \w Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w has turned|strong="H2015"\w* \w its back|strong="H6203"\w* \w and run from|strong="H6440"\w* \w its enemies|strong="H341"\w*? \v 9 \w When the Canaanites|strong="H3669"\w* \w and all|strong="H3605"\w* \w who live|strong="H3427"\w* \w in the land|strong="H776"\w* \w hear about this|strong="H8085"\w*, \w they will surround|strong="H5437"\w* \w us|strong="H5921"\w* \w and wipe out|strong="H3772"\w* \w our name|strong="H8034"\w* \w from|strong="H4480"\w* \w the earth|strong="H776"\w*. \w Then what|strong="H4100"\w* \w will You do|strong="H6213"\w* \w for Your great|strong="H1419"\w* \w name|strong="H8034"\w*?”
