\p \w Moses|strong="H4872"\w* \w had struck them down|strong="H5221"\w* \w and dispossessed them|strong="H3423"\w*, \v 13 \w but the Israelites|strong="H1121"\w* \w did not|strong="H3808"\w* \w drive out|strong="H3423"\w* \w the Geshurites|strong="H1651"\w* \w or|strong="H853"\w* \w the Maacathites|strong="H4602"\w*. \w So Geshur|strong="H1650"\w* \w and Maacath|strong="H4601"\w* \w dwell|strong="H3427"\w* \w among|strong="H7130"\w* \w the Israelites|strong="H3478"\w* \w to|strong="H5704"\w* \w this|strong="H2088"\w* \w day|strong="H3117"\w*.
