\p \v 29 \w This is what Moses|strong="H4872"\w* \w had given|strong="H5414"\w* \w to the clans|strong="H4940"\w* \w of the half-tribe|strong="H2677"\w* \w of Manasseh|strong="H4519"\w*, \w that is|strong="H1961"\w*, \w to half|strong="H2677"\w* \w the tribe|strong="H4294"\w* \w of the descendants|strong="H1121"\w* \w of Manasseh|strong="H4519"\w*:
