\p \v 24 \w But in fact|strong="H518"\w* \w we have done|strong="H6213"\w* \w this|strong="H2063"\w* \w for fear|strong="H1674"\w* \w that in the future|strong="H4279"\w* \w your descendants|strong="H1121"\w* \w might say|strong="H559"\w* \w to ours|strong="H1121"\w*, ‘\w What|strong="H4100"\w* have you to do \w with the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*, \w the God|strong="H430"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*? \v 25 \w For the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w has made|strong="H5414"\w* \w the Jordan|strong="H3383"\w* \w a border|strong="H1366"\w* \w between us|strong="H996"\w* \w and you|strong="H996"\w* \w Reubenites|strong="H7205"\w* \w and|strong="H1121"\w* \w Gadites|strong="H1410"\w*. \w You have no|strong="H369"\w* \w share|strong="H2506"\w* \w in the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*!’ \w So your descendants could cause|strong="H1121"\w* \w ours|strong="H1121"\w* \w to stop|strong="H7673"\w* \w fearing|strong="H3372"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w*.
